{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1368,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7524a90602223c20e35b9310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着替えました～ぁあっ！？\r\n静電気がピリッと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea820454abb50211025a7788304f15400ad4bd5e6aac110ebc3f48f64b490405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f23de160da85eaf77967ea20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎回踏んで転ぶから、\r\n実は裾上げしてるんです…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0661a457efb6b904531cf9ecf47eb3d2f9a88eee95e478fb6d1c9d57c95981f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c321345b7410abed52641d37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也还是觉得像做梦一样～\r\n我竟然穿着特雷森学园的制服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8958b4edbac03565a28d884c1d89d2e690e57b803b930a9d916223309b5ab70a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cfbaa3e3970698e15ee7a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着蓬松衣服的时候，\r\n连心情也会跟着变轻松呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc428a52975873a50d56ef7ac098a1c18a363d68504b5b953c98875d77af383c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ccc2f2f7200f43d9472515c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样……？\r\n我会不会驾驭不了决胜服……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8885b9246356cf84cb0b7c4c42c82ce158ea4a4a841945189079ad6fc0fb3007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c84afcadd9ed6a9aa8cdba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个缎带已经是第五条了……\r\n因为常常不小心被我勾破……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3d4e8c0bdfd48935d9472c084ec0cafa5a1b99c82c36d480a36a246cb4b30e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1982e9590660f3a4159f5b67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……Live的时候，\r\n要小心不要跌倒弄脏了衣服……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e702240ae1253e1de8e90715f94d987421864f62f088e616ac3b5dd3f3ccb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b9ce5ba26d6a221d3db3cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包包里装着创可贴和绷带。\r\n这样就不怕冒失受伤了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe7a5bb8082758ef3b2d5d5ecbb294526c72d9de2c966bd8d8a0791a7d16a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c582f04baa7d838537517c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着灯笼的火焰，会感到很放松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c4c220cb09b651db63fd136674b8401f1d4595e12ed522215e448af400587b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f886ab434c1465686a2cb60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收在袖子里的点心，都掉出来了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09bcd13f5ef4290a8dcbc9ac09edaddda0b35a961346dfa3a6262ecc4f78653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b66b5d9c4279a329beb6cc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93402554c851c294fa17a86e09545ac448b5c8b1596635e17c61e567ce865ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bded6c9303a8efe06f872963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我会努力赢的……我能赢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7801c0a9c3101dba627ed9729b21b080e77734f55ea763b2b9aa1ea7c57aa740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7d10674332134184373fa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛、辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "434971ca5a08c2f72f5dd8dc81fc1ae00f277b431b213745dc506a8ea4419f04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b915a496bcff59e7a474e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しょ、勝負です…！\r\n………ひえぇ、\r\n言っちゃったぁぁぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48d1c8f41229e1e6e367b914b178731eea34780330db0692a120bf4da7903273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2413eb7b67acdcb3858f201b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あうぅ…ま、まだいけます…。\r\n私、まだがんばれます…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5ef4c279b4ca2d201af9da24a84c73f55c2b284f969cca0baf4f87cb262e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93df140484284b5922a6968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安～\r\n……请问我头发应该没有乱吧……？\r\n应该没有乱七八糟的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "529692acd0ada44056338a5aa51d5cacc53346a4799f75f258717d25aed9a9cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5946953bc1e6ead06a60098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好歌剧和乌拉拉她们两个，\r\n每次都是一早就很有精神哦～\r\n我也要向她们看齐才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b703fc5a2915b015c805dc448395cc26c2e7c09ca8c466b3286a7af18fe2729b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa6d10d8572184e084023ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经吃过午餐了吗？\r\n我……因为面包被小鸟抢走了，\r\n所以要再去买一次……",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f55e13f2fb31b0f5b74a25dcc4067956bc0f1096c3243e3dfc0415c7600341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082efee47893069110f6a19e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐过后总是会很想睡觉……\r\n要小心不要像之前一样，\r\n走错到隔壁教室去才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8f319ce48747a7be624ceda2c9d93792b78171b97a996e54321e2e20ae8daa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16e0d3e1eec3a648ee9656d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上会让人觉得很平静呢……\r\n有种……心情沮丧、低落，\r\n好像也没关系的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b9728305b4e35096269648a583c6ba0949ea956a4e087aef8301316d645233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1078c2cca52af2f703f8881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天也辛苦了～\r\n明天我会努力不制造麻烦的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ac558e90af4a47bab3586af2851f2f64e003f0f1799dfc14f747bf453cac78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7acb74a7361d46a13c3ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想着在新生面前要抬头挺胸……\r\n结、结果，不小心抽筋了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4a7b43b78cc9b8f49e707dbf3155b5fe82433afee22fdcab7bb5c7eedfc8c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a138ace0747dd1bf27b038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天……虽然我很怕热，\r\n但向日葵和耀眼的阳光……\r\n我就好像还满喜欢的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3d9c153277628861ff7a4ff7d05662fa5540cb46663478dde64d33bc3e0bd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21544247219855cf37499fa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老师在课堂上出了一个题目叫──\r\n「自己的秋天是什么样子？」……\r\n也有适合我、属于我的秋天吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7eb0691c2f536a60efbdf06b73aecee074b660f6d00b61fe68b4a6f357128f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e158539c20ffa1839af992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我冬天的时候没有那么怕冷，\r\n毕竟小时候是在北方长大的，\r\n而且我还有暖呼呼的手套～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b229ce0605ba7be761fe4851fe25e51d94c353a4fe9c193d1c79944413b0c42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de85c9820383849b4ca8358a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n我来替你带路……咦？\r\n今天鬼屋还没正式开张！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0058b18b58ed05fd9a0bf96c72ae22748e56ceb716e8565bec1ea7260d0a436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76d58b42e47682346528896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丝、丝袜破洞了……！啊呜……\r\n之前被神宫提醒之后，\r\n才换过一件的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "17634626aae8290bb2579c5be5fa098f80833234dce5c509df5da46e4785aed8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54cb487eecccff9553e7fe55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼屋里又暗又恐怖……\r\n……啊，如果跟白天一样亮的话，\r\n就连胆子小的人也能玩了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9b538f0de0e21f85db92e285565e0d62e8ab17018e6b1fe2ad88c40de09e5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9670da7b11b753bbd003798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……对不起。\r\n替大家做的南瓜派……\r\n现在只剩下焦炭了～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "937730bf38a0fc7be034ab30999f1566ecb89cf46264a531b8d6e0397b797a37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b1df3095d305b56d8d26b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这、这里很暗，\r\n走路要小心一点喔……！\r\n虽然、我在亮的地方也会跌倒……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bc345f0f8f5e974003a6748af4eb2aa58c30bc311848b464fec16662ec9342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d99f741286de13a820926b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀啊！？训练员！？\r\n那我刚才主动搭话却被忽视\r\n是因为……噫～！我认错人了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf5f0547713b2271b259ae0e6efe308235174b41046fa777fe12d1453c5d2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6742bd116dd1548b37a2433c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春、春天的风真可怕呢。\r\n我曾经追着被风吹走的帽子，\r\n结果遇难……我已经怕了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ddbd33501e21bdfac0d15c104d6cf9233b8ed69fcfc357e6a217ba35afdd658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd618a2e45e441375b4d0502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采收起来的巨大南瓜被我弄掉后，\r\n就裂成了两半……\r\n我会花一辈子的时间补偿～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7459b654d4cb60c21a049f063a01c02ea5f8262f1407bd9ab6fd726b3ad182f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32a1a264c77a64340164291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所、所谓的捣蛋，\r\n到底该怎么做才好……！呜呜……\r\n压力让我开始头晕了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5715cce65f713401184fd96461864dc830986549a153a62798429d4a709bd49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3fb2078a07add6bf6ecfa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在天气冷的时候把帽子放在外面，\r\n结果有小狸猫钻进去。当我发现时\r\n它已经在里面睡着了……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "994a17914dc016de31054acc858c6877fd6393235e14d1a5862a050a3141c6d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeac22f6479f6b809f230f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6ffc9161024d8b88b1cfe73fa8db72a5ab444a7d7577c34ba02a341922b476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4632edb215995aafa6c83b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6ffc9161024d8b88b1cfe73fa8db72a5ab444a7d7577c34ba02a341922b476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b0c4d217c8f06319449fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情低落的时候，\r\n不会想要躲起来吗？\r\n像是躲在阴暗处，或是谁的背后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a49f1571c652250057f739701c9730c7415a7c1cc3b8fca5e948c4fa6855205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d0d58f5489616ceccec632",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的父母真的非常温柔哦。\r\n都会说「怒涛是了不起的孩子」……\r\n明明我一点都不优秀的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6997e3600c96e6d366375b689a8898139837582d057ed8f8595cdbbed975d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca90065ec52dff1fe9d718ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……我正是世纪末霸王！\r\n哈──哈哈哈！！\r\n…………有、有像吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "460a41fc380d69160598f7bcdbb586a8364c5d63b8d3fa18c7b68d1b522f7cab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004485edfdba0d9683687042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也希望自己跟好歌剧的关系\r\n能像织姬那样……\r\n不行，那样太令人惶恐了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "045145ff03b790b786d6f43a4a6a1cfdaa0b180049973bf87ec45063a6d51cc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921b4cac821f3dd41fce9f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇……\r\n大树快车约我参加派对，\r\n但我会不会很突兀啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a14541adf81e6a5fadbd8eef7dcdb7bd11ce723f49b49a045a2ddae7dd5300b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2d62f0fa1840953b8889e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "扣子太多的衣服我有点……\r\n因为我很冒失嘛，\r\n就很常会扣错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b58fb3d4235f3f40c918ad7765fbf5de4e858315255944b1eec1a92e55e756b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aaf1b4596273375fc86616c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要唱节奏很快的歌的时候，\r\n不觉得会很紧张吗……？\r\n……好、好像会吃螺丝的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e7e1d7ef53467f5876687e33da3d3f1f8550d2887e151d4398d4bb240ba4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14e7df933f42e2b431b906b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有这个包包，\r\n就会有一百倍的勇气～\r\n要是……实力也能多一百倍就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0be6e2f327b97a25d6161a4c6d0a9da0c96798e9c86e8b55844863cddf4d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf7f98f1540434eb106e945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包包和胸前的蝴蝶结很可爱，\r\n是我最喜欢的部份哦～\r\n光是戴在身上就能获得鼓励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb3c5512a2f04631ebccf94b5130de0529c7712f0efb2f2d3b93db91034045c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdeaf9988da0b6a55e36fd8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还想说包包怎么这么重……\r\n结果里面装的不是课本，\r\n是我的闹钟～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd8f9583798ca9b75553b954905355ef2edff1d1d3dfc1ac6c82db485c4cb84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce2fcb4625a8f76daa53470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贩卖部的胡萝卜面包……\r\n我虽然想吃吃看，\r\n但要比动作快的话，我好像不行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9931fc6d407bfbe6f85cd1236eb768fa5caf39ba9d907836b0c32976b265381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75bd702b4a5ca2fe27000be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上走在路上是很危险的……\r\n很容易撞到或是跌倒，\r\n走到宿舍的时候都已经累翻了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "567230f1bb07cda5862c77ce7b74b72f8050b788410e0831f6de867517c8c20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9342242f66ea99d708552d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花是很危险的……\r\n走路的时候不小心看太入迷，\r\n撞到柱子肿了好大一包呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4a4f5953651093010e90a5f6550d51c2370029f1687bc7c86d532ac2ac9700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67577281d5c0817bd7005026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边是很危险的……\r\n会被生气的螃蟹先生夹手指，\r\n游泳圈还会被浪卷走……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a567af1468c255e25aa87fdf7f0bf4aef5c96479e4245b96df4a8e82cce3ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca6900899dfd4b14eb8a002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烤、烤地瓜是很危险的～！\r\n不仔细吹凉的话，\r\n就会像我一样烫到舌头……呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "038a4b4188e17819ac8a2bdca76b9b95bd9b04068b6995f8e258018472308b9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805f6ca3af30d3be58a98f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪……虽然很漂亮，但也很危险。\r\n我常常在下坡的时候滑倒……\r\n滚得变成像雪球一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "999c9e88e57a69f42d07d8c7b9776ebe33851ed6355ae66c725b07f5d1accf88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23aaf72c6f5b7c3aba4330bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我舍不得吃糖果，就一直盯着看……\r\n结果脑中浮现出身为宝石商人的\r\n爸爸的脸喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa343a7fdabf783cfca3101a53d1210e68e588a0b506c6276d6822b2a6591bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157584d407f96cff1f7d49a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数码一天会倒下好几次再爬起来……\r\n我想她一定是累了吧。\r\n送慰劳品给她，会给她造成麻烦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2094a34852457bbce20da04ebdfb42ee0d265c2bb16af879bb7089d1d51db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28057cbce752c81b361fe77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风好像都不会咬我。\r\n她说我哭得太夸张很无聊……\r\n这让我感到有点寂寞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd10d7dd536e83134aad41fcd3c1ef1829f1c60b3c45f7ba08408a65b1cff95e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072ba0544296a3b0f2d699bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔、喔耶～～！耶～～！\r\n我我、我做对了吗？这是太阳教我的\r\n派对玩咖招呼法……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00744a9a570bd681800501b02ed9761f3a1bd5dca4d27b31eab49d2a28de3c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c4a6d6c3c211e63b3d31bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信连听我唱演歌时，\r\n都会表现得很兴奋……嘿嘿。\r\n希望还能跟她一起去唱卡拉OK……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3c619371d40b7ea1c247216ae858e2c876f5e2f1eaa37951480b1c05d1e3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5340e6008f4108b8b7a543b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的占卜说，\r\n我的幸运物是南瓜……耶嘿嘿。\r\n或、或许，会遇到好事喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e1796831f48dbdf218e7145cb93dc69aa77ed006c9e1644f2f43b34592828e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82e0acbc990b63a9a322d22f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点、点心时间，我和乌拉拉\r\n会各自带点心来聚会。\r\n今天要带什么好呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd55db81c51df4387ef701bd9708d98c614ac7cb15b20d0cbacfe935547bb340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0abf1ead44c923c6bb0f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一到晚上，\r\n就会有猫跑来找我玩。\r\n是因为喜欢这件衣服吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9e391123126f0b28934ea2fb699f44584786c0b8b47110f0cd5d724dab219c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee27d25226ef290f1b574d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……我真是个糟糕的前辈！\r\n我悄～悄地向迷路的新生搭话后，\r\n对方就被我吓哭了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae126bb7067c95960f0f41e002d023ebbb84a246be37dfdf6c576cc6f4a878b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f07ae8d4dab6d7f7406a829",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……请、请问……你有水吗？\r\n我戴着南瓜打瞌睡后，\r\n流了一身汗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f12f533ce9d70e1dab6dfcb1643f8ec0a643b79b458dfd14a7611179173d823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9465af6c0a7904ab43ddaa5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我……一定很难吃的。\r\n可是，大家只要一看见我，\r\n就会说「肚子饿了」……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f5a21e680f74da848c4867265e5d1e1edb1267d5b605bb7f11b074024f9bd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d01e9c91d2893906ef74774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不、不介意的话，请过来这里……\r\n灯笼很暖和喔。\r\n怎么样……我有帮上忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c3f0fa884408884e6842a6a19a639964b43ba20c3ad85fd5d9dff2c4f8ce62c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d424103807878a730c5f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴上南瓜后，\r\n感觉自己就像是换了一个人。\r\n变成比平常、强大一点的我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9299bb6920151373ac1625d05204c2a2a57dc9b2253107607b1e3d66ea55d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091bf818ec504c955f2bb999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我外出时，不知为何总是会被\r\n乌鸦盯上……唔哇！？\r\n怎么有这么多南瓜碎屑啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f965277e9b066af0dacd6a4ad9df859855d3015904fb9258759d492e1763793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e1423c46a27bddc53ac0e14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今、今天的训练也拜偷你了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a97edd4914dd61ad637cf09bcf56264e0bf8c2ac9dc0c9742fbf08f49af18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf0d0d044073cb948b3bbe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よ、よーし",
      "source_fingerprint": "527fd1e7be31d241dade9d8affb95505bbfbca7ba717b63d1777774c35574e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386738123d75582d3e92e2f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做什么训练呢……？\r\n因为我自己选不出来……\r\n你能帮我做决定的话就太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27268cbf19458070a8363c4cde2a17a2f662f08acd35ce12d031a1b94d5bef7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4ee1453fe5318f5cbec078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很、很抱歉我来晚了……！\r\n我总算是做完准备工作了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "277218a2f014b44ee57242c26f31b9fc45baa3e6408224eb280faf4257871aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e494dd7e637eac091bf2d35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习的时候，\r\n我会小心不要出状况的……\r\n所以，能麻烦你指导我做吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a736321c9abd0686828f9fe07015c898566fcaeed983650bed76ef150bbbc426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a75746ce5c6aa7adf9d5279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算只是一点点……\r\n只要继续向前进就会改变的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f211f5516d4c035ca735fa8941020476b5ec8e026d08033cc23b38fcf281f622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c895d568e6133b0288fe59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是为了没有抛弃我的训练员……\r\n我也要有更多的成长才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93780161fd095795d45486f1daafc6432ae8ef99bc87e197054fe2ec2696e9d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709a42886b69944d0146ac5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想说能在训练的时候，\r\n让你看到不一样的我……！\r\n应该多少……稍微有点改变吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "175dde2059ad3b1d61af80804f424938713e3303b25e7be6d951e2b5b9c75f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6194b80c5586e40a9c0d0a67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕、毕竟是集训嘛，\r\n所以……\r\n就希望可以做到确实的锻炼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7539ca71466e61c8f7ae55f4ffa17dd39393b419bac116a227ad0544255e5af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:518f786211147fc6fcfb7472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么训练项目，我都能完成！\r\n因、因为我知道训练员指示的道路，\r\n是正确的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d986d117eac335b65bdbac23d6e351fea09b29d3664eaad79931f4830cec79c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68319d87bdf979c0a1db436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为、为了避免发生坏事，\r\n用衣服的力量把厄运赶捧……！？\r\n呜哇～咬到舌抖了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19db5d82234cdabada459131d1bfc0cb21f23f4b71f6b984dcced65e44654e93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e423bfc0c62f288fbbf5e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呃……我、我没事。\r\n我只是稍微把脖子上的缎带绑紧，\r\n让它不会松掉而已……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c93213b54444cb9db182a917d91585363dbb2b212cbf4384b31ea7442e7d2f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cf748900ebf989c26874bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，今天的我跟平时不太一样喔。\r\n这双高跟鞋很好穿，\r\n我目前只有跌倒一次而已……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ea717f1f01ae57defd707e24a3d8bba545a3240d241e2e9820500ddb459cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
